      "writtenOn": "2026-09-22T07:52:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Rewritten along those lines. Each test pushes quota.config with maxStartForTaskForUserForQueue \u003d 1 uploadpack \u003cname\u003e, starts the plugin on it, then runs two real upload-packs over SSH as user1: with auth.userNameCaseInsensitive the uppercase spelling parks the second one, without it neither parks, and a username no account has parks nothing either. It asserts on the task states in the queue.\n\nOne wart worth flagging: it uses the batch queue, because the acceptance framework pins sshd.threads to 1, so on the interactive queue there is no thread left for a task to park on next to a running one.",
